ECHO BLE mesh (Sources/Core/Mesh)
=================================

The design of this mesh layer — TTL-bounded flooding with per-message dedup,
store-and-forward relay, payload fragmentation/reassembly, and a GATT
write/notify transport — is derived from bitchat by permissionless.tech
(https://github.com/permissionlesstech/bitchat), which is released into the
public domain under The Unlicense.

bitchat is public domain; no attribution is required. This NOTICE is provided
as a courtesy to record provenance. ECHO-specific identity, end-to-end crypto,
trust/verification gating, and UI are original to this project.

Mesh constants (service/characteristic UUIDs) are ECHO's own and are NOT
interoperable with the bitchat network.
